<title>CROATIA: Croatia April ind.output up 2 pct m/m, 6.5 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatia April ind.output up 2 pct m/m, 6.5 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details. Previous data are in brackets.</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     APRIL     MARCH     APR '96</p>
<p> Monthly change pct		+2.0	+3.9	 +0.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	     +6.5   +5.3(+5.5)    +2.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		107.8  105.7(105.9)  101.2</p>
<p>NOTES -- April figures are preliminary. January-April output rise was put at 3.7 percent compared to the same year-ago period. Data include estimates for Serb-held Eastern Slavonia which represents some two percent of the reporting base.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
